---
import BasePage from "../layouts/BasePage.astro";
---

<BasePage>
  <div class="con-content">
    <!-- <div class="img-banner"/>x -->

    <h1>Trips</h1>

    <h2>Easter Week</h2>
    <p>
        Arguably not a trip, as it's based at Portmoak, however Easter Week is a chance to hang out with 
        pilots from across the UK including other University pilots who come up especially to experience 
        our excellent flying conditions. There will be flying, there will be fun, there will be a BBQ and yes, 
        there will be banter. 
    </p>

    <h1>Facebook Events</h1>
    <p>
        We'll announce our trips and other socials via our 
        <a href="http://www.facebook.com/pages/Edinburgh-University-Gliding-Club/166398523439594">Facebook page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BasePage>

<style>
    .con-content {
        margin-left: 10%;
        margin-right: 10%;

        margin-top: 96px;
        margin-bottom: 96px;

        text-align: justify;
    }
    .con-content h1 {
        margin-top: 48px;
    }

    a {
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--col-accent);
	}

    .img-banner {
        background-image: url("../assets/training.jpeg");
        background-size: cover;

        width: 100%;
        height: 500px;

        border-radius: 8px;
    }
</style>